# No deploy until asked

Do not deploy, merge to `main`, or push to production until the user explicitly says to deploy.

Work stays on the current feature branch. Commit and push that branch when the change should be saved, and leave production (`main` / Vercel) untouched.

Never force-push, skip hooks, amend a pushed commit, or update git config unless the user explicitly requests that.
